{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_222f49717790435e947355ffc48e587d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_426a84bdac74b688192cf0b1631beb17609fb60c06034f6f1b59cb1480019ab5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"presstab/jrdev@6fa64e9aa863 snapshot e89fbd92ce10e510","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_bfe1b761b1908381b349cee4e18bd6e6c612cf0ed81a50455fb29e2feb0e6aef"],"source_ids":["src_7474f03bafcd55e4b59591f81b5b63fe"],"text":"The /projectcontext command supports subcommands on|off, status, list, view <filepath>, update, refresh <filepath>, add <filepath>, and remove <filepath> for managing project context.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_222f49717790435e947355ffc48e587d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_222f49717790435e947355ffc48e587d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_54b74496b779163e5a040a56e6932b84535403d1dff4c43b3fd51202f64b8357","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"presstab/jrdev@6fa64e9aa863 snapshot e89fbd92ce10e510","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1742f3b1dc6e342809528414613a692ffe860eea80aeb2fecadf2a13cc53102a","slc_da0cf36b4dd82690d0c26c9819055307273c211eda52d252e2e1809b3b442ce5"],"source_ids":["src_635d3730573d568e8e78061c64856d3c","src_d2c7fec36eba5ae48e0d0b0086f942ea"],"text":"The tool can modify project files and prompts for confirmation unless in 'Accept All' mode; execute-phase diffs offer Accept, Accept All, Edit, No, or Request Change options.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_222f49717790435e947355ffc48e587d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_222f49717790435e947355ffc48e587d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_873d656b10fdc5e96fc4ad47e7ec24e948d552a22db668fb4078a2978ca71a17","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"presstab/jrdev@6fa64e9aa863 snapshot e89fbd92ce10e510","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_09dd69b938c86a02fbf241728dc08d090939df3a92697a08e0865bb54d42e42b"],"source_ids":["src_d2c7fec36eba5ae48e0d0b0086f942ea"],"text":"The /code agent runs a six-phase pipeline: Analyze, Fetch Context, Plan, Execute, Review, and Validate, ending with files updated on disk.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_222f49717790435e947355ffc48e587d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_222f49717790435e947355ffc48e587d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8bde0e16789966adb0e710ef3dede923d7116834fe2dba46e41274fed2a22144","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"presstab/jrdev@6fa64e9aa863 snapshot e89fbd92ce10e510","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d456f51c67bbff95bb83a0574b233ba7b16672838e8047738168c175429abbb1"],"source_ids":["src_d2c7fec36eba5ae48e0d0b0086f942ea"],"text":"The Plan phase produces an ordered JSON plan of file-modification steps, validates each filename against loaded files, and offers accept, edit, accept-all, reprompt (restarting at Analyze), or cancel.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:32:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_222f49717790435e947355ffc48e587d"}
